    "description": {
      "value": "Each of these unassuming sacks contains enough rotting fruit to provide a leshy with 1 week's worth of rations, along with clusters of stones to help press out the fruit's juices. When you Strike a creature with a sack of rotten fruit, the sack is consumed while the creature takes 1d4 bludgeoning damage and must attempt a DC 15 Fortitude save. On a failure, the creature is sickened 1. The range increment of a thrown sack of rotten fruit is 20 feet.\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Strike"
